4.ii
    Consider Rinf(t) = u(t)
    
    Rewriting the equation using integrating factor method
    R' + (1/22) * R = u(t) / 22
    u(x) = e^(integral(1/22) dt)
    <=> u(x) = e^(t/22)
    e^(t/22) * R(t) - R(0) = integral (e^(t/22) * u(t)/22 dt)
    
    R(0) = 0 based on initial conditions

    R(t) = e^(-t/22) * integral (e^(t/22) * u(t)/22 dt)
    R(t) = e^(-t/22) / 22 * integral(e^(t/22) * u(t) dt) [t0 -> t]
    R(t) = e^(-t/22) / 22 * integral(e^(t/22)) dt [0 -> t]
    R(t) = e^(-t/22) / 22 * (22 * e^(t/22) - 22)
    R(t) = e^(-t/22) * (e^(t/22) - 1)
    R(t) = 1 - e^(-t/22) t>= 0, 0 for t < 0
    Unit Step Response!

    We can do this because we have the assumtion of 0 initial conditions.

